title: John_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_John = "">>
<<setPhase John>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_John == "begin">>
<<jump John_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_John == "comeback">>
<<jump John_Comeback01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_John == "rewardGiven">>
<<jump John_RewardGiven01>>
<<else>>
John: My boss told me you forgot to add dialogue.
<<endif>>
===
title: John_Begin01
---
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: Hey there, I'm John.
<<camMove John_CamRig "pc">>
You: Oh wow! You're John from that thing!
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: What?
<<camMove John_CamRig "pc">>
You: Ah... nothing. Nevermind.
You: So do you have a Maxwell for me?
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: Nope. I'm barely scraping by as it is.
John: My job barely pays me and my boss won't even give me a week off to go to my favorite convention!
John: It really sucks.
<<camMove John_CamRig "pc">>
You: I'm sorry to hear that John.
You: But something tells me things will get better for you.
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: Thanks. I doubt it.
<<camMove John_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase John "comeback">>
===
title: John_Comeback01
---
<<camMove John_CamRig "pc">>
You: Y'know John, maybe you should just stick it to your boss and take a week's leave anyway.
You: What is he gonna do, fire you?
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: Yes.
<<camMove John_CamRig "pc">>
You: Oh. Well so what? Then at least you won't have a job you hate!
You: It can't hurt, can it?
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: ...
<<camMove John_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase John "rewardGiven">>
===
title: John_RewardGiven01
---
<<camMove John_CamRig "npc">>
John: ...
<<camMove John_CamRig "return">>
===